  "MiniOutput(label: string, value: any, size?: \"body\" | \"display\" | \"compact\", align?: \"start\" | \"center\" | \"end\") — Labelled reactive text, number, boolean, object or array result. Pass expressions or registered function results. Null displays a clear invalid/empty-result message. No HTML execution.",
